{"articleNo":"513105","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=513105&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2025년 화성시인재육성재단 주거비지원 장학금 신청 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.04.29","hit":"5283","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmFYHoQFkgZAkgFQJoC8BmA5AigIQHcAtAZXQGEBnAcwFVEALAUQDoArABxqA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">장학금명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">화성시인재육성재단 주거비지원 장학금</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.9pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">지원자격</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.2pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -37.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">본인 또는 부모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">친권자가 화성시에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">년 이상 연속 거주한 비수도권 대학 재학생&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">비수도권</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">서울</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">경기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">인천을 제외한 국내 지역</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.9pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">한국장학재단 학자금 지원구간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">분위 이내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.9pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">대학교 인근에서 자취 또는 기숙사 입소자로 증빙서류 제출 가능한 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.9pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">지원금액</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 200</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">학기당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">만원씩 분할지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.9pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">모집기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2025. 5. 2.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) 9</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">~ 5. 21.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) 17</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font